      en: ["A 25-hectare safari park in the Subic Bay Freeport Zone.", "Famous for its Tiger Safari in a customized jeepney.", "Features full-grown Siberian tigers in a large enclosure.", "The Savannah allows free-roaming ostriches and wild boars.", "Includes a Serpentarium with a collection of reptiles.", "The Croco Loco attraction is a bridge over a crocodile pit.", "Combines entertainment with animal conservation awareness."]
