      en: ["An amusement park in the Cultural Center of the Philippines Complex, Pasay.", "Known for its mix of indoor and outdoor attractions.", "A major draw is Snow World, which features real snow.", "The Giant Star Wheel is a 60-meter tall Ferris wheel.", "Suffered a major fire in 2019 and was subsequently rebuilt.", "Reopened in 2022 with new and refurbished attractions.", "A beloved entertainment destination for Filipino families."]
